	(text_box "1. Function: J5 and J6 are the Option B LDO Board V3's two DF40C-80DP plugs (top face). They mate Option B Router V3 sockets J5/J6 (DF40C-80DS, router B.Cu) pin n to pin n at 5.00 mm pitch (1.5 mm stack), carrying 128 signal contacts (121 nets from Frontend J1/J2 on Sheet 1), all nine ASIC rails, AGND, GND, and ASIC_AC_IN. Each of the eight split rails is tied J5 even to J6 odd on its regulator output; VDD_CGEN is tied J5.1-J6.2; AGND J5.42/44 = J6.41/43; GND J5.3/5/46/48 = J6.4/6/45/47. NT1 is the single AGND-GND star bond; TP20 provides an AGND probe pad beside the plugs. ASIC_AC_IN (J5.69/J6.70) is bridged with no load here because R6/TP7 stay on Option B Router V3.\n\n2. Source / changes: Built by Antigravity from PIN_MAP_B_V2.csv and SYNTHESIS.md sections 3 & 5 (24 Nov 2026), upgrading Option B LDO V2 (single 120-pin J5) to 2 x DF40C-80DP-0.4V(51) (Hirose DF40 data sheet https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/C294544.pdf ; JLC C294544, 5759 orderable, read 2026-11-25 07:31 CST). Board becomes a 22.69 x 40.30 mm rectangle (y 117.634-157.935), Frontend sits +5.0 mm south unchanged. Escape layers mirror FPGA-LDO A V24 (J5 S=L1, J5 N=L2, J6 S=L5, J6 N=L6; BOARD3_SPI_LATCH on L2). Unverified: 3.80 mm J5-to-J1/J2 fan-out corridor and JLC HDI via-in-pad review."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 337.82 116.4 0)
		(size 149.86 32)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.254)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "650124ef-56f5-59f9-9c68-d53b16ab9d96")
	)
	(text_box "1. Function: Seventeen 1 uF 0402 capacitors (C51-C67) decouple the nine ASIC rails directly at the J5/J6 plug pins (two per split rail + C56 on VDD_CGEN). Fifteen return to AGND; C54 and C60 (ASIC_DVDD) return to GND to match the ASIC digital return domain.\n\n2. Source / changes: Required by SYNTHESIS.md sections 3 & 5 because C51/C53-C57 moved off Option B Router V3. Part Samsung CL05A105KA5NQNC 1 uF 25 V X5R 0402 (JLC Basic C52923, 10067775 orderable, read 2026-11-25 07:31 CST, https://jlcpcb.com/partdetail/C52923 ). DVDD caps C54/C60 return to GND per FPGA-LDO A V24 (review LDOA-11/-16), matching Carrier V7. Unverified: stability with full ASIC stack capacitance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 345.44 158.75 0)
