			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8358136a-ad74-5212-811c-3bda3551f9ca")
	)
	(text_box "1. Function: Ten of the seventeen 10k safe-idle resistors sit on J5 lines: R2/R3/R4/R5 (STIM_EN/START/CHB/CLK_SHARED), R16 (FE_RESET_SHARED), R17 (IMP_TST_SHARED), R21 (BOARD3_CLK), R23 (BOARD3_SPI_CLK), R28 (BOARD3_SPI_LATCH) pull low; R19 pulls CHIP_RESET_SHARED up to ASIC_DVDD so the ASICs stay in reset while the Artix-7 Frontend configures (PUDC_B tied high on Frontend).\n\n2. Source / changes: Copied from FPGA-LDO A V24 (R2-R5, R16-R28; Claude design from Gerald's top_custom.v & spi_programmer.v, Uniroyal 0402WGF1002TCE 10k 1% 0402, JLC Basic C25744, 27097705 orderable, read 2026-11-25 07:31 CST, https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/C25744.pdf ). Upgrades Option B LDO V2 (which lacked R20-R28); drawn directly wired on the plug pin lines per AGENTS.md visible-wiring rule."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.91 275.59 0)
		(size 150 24.3)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.254)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7e6b0824-b3e4-505c-8bc1-8ed8841a0c1c")
	)
	(text_box "1. Function: R24-R27 hold the top chips' SPI clocks and latches low while the Frontend FPGA configures: R27 ASIC7_8_TOP_SPI_LATCH (J5.70), R25 ASIC7_8_TOP_SPI_CLK (J5.72), R26 ASIC3_4_TOP_SPI_LATCH (J6.69), R24 ASIC3_4_TOP_SPI_CLK (J6.71).\n\n2. Source / changes: Copied from FPGA-LDO A V24 (JLC Basic C25744, read 2026-11-25 07:31 CST); drawn directly on the plug pin lines for Option B LDO V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
