	(text_box "1. Function: R20 (BOARD1_CLK, J6.8), R18 (BOARD1_SPI_LATCH, J6.62), and R22 (BOARD1_SPI_CLK, J6.64) hold the lower ASIC board's clock and SPI clock/latch low while the Frontend FPGA configures.\n\n2. Source / changes: Copied from FPGA-LDO A V24 (JLC Basic C25744, read 2026-11-25 07:31 CST); drawn directly on the plug pin lines for Option B LDO V3."
